27067\" data-has-big width=800 height=388 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is the story behind Lost Island ?</h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the bustling ports of a vast island, merchants from across the seas gathered to trade goods, share stories and swap news. One story that captured their imagination was the story of the Lost Island, a mysterious land. It is said that the Lost Island The tribes that were once at the peak of their power were famous for their unique customs and knowledge. But these tribes were united by one formidable element: a plant with fantastic powers. As beautiful as this plant was to behold, it was rumoured to possess dark, hidden powers that wreaked havoc on those who encountered it.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tales spread far and wide, finally reaching the ears of the king. Intrigued and worried by the rumours, the king summoned his most trusted advisers to reveal the truth behind the lost island and its cursed plant. He hoped to find a way to discover the danger and perhaps unlock the secret of the plant's powers for the benefit of his kingdom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446020/extras/95a1d73723501496cec7439ee6f44107.avif?t=1739227067\" data-has-big width=800 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
